# Java Practice

This repository contains my solutions to various [LeetCode](https://leetcode.com/) problems, implemented in **Java**.

## 📁 Structure

Each file or folder corresponds to a specific LeetCode problem. Solutions are organized by problem name or number for easy navigation.

## 🛠️ Technologies

- Java 17+
- Standard libraries only (no external frameworks)

## 🚀 How to Run

```bash
javac ProblemName.java
java ProblemName
